Acid tests
==========

Acid2 and Acid3 are vendored from Web Platform Tests:
  Upstream: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt
  Paths:    acid/acid2/, acid/acid3/
  License:  BSD-3-Clause (WPT)
  Fetched:  2026-10-04

Acid1 is not vendored: its canonical location
(https://www.w3.org/Style/CSS/Test/acid1/acid1.html) currently returns 404 and
no canonical mirror was reachable. It should be added from the Web Standards
Project archive when available.

These are rendering-level tests. They cannot pass until layout (Phase 6) and
painting (Phase 7) exist, and Acid3 additionally needs the JavaScript engine
(Phase 10). They are vendored now so the rendering phases have a target.
